  "prefLabel": "He-P 1908.03 Size of Signs",
  "priorExpiration": "2018-11-20",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 1908.03 Size of Signs. Signs shall meet the following size requirements as specified in Table 1900.1.\n\nTable 1900.1 Size of Signs\n\nFarthest Distance from which Sign Is to Be Read | Height of Lettering | Diameter of Outer Circle for International Symbol for Smoking or No-Smoking\n\n25 feet | 1/2 inch | 3 inches\n\n50 feet | 1 inch | 4 inches\n\n150 feet | 2 inches | 6 inches\n\n350 feet | 4 inches | 8 inches\n\n500 feet | 6 inches | 12 inches\n\nSource. #5759, eff 12-20-93; ss by #7172, eff 12-21-99, EXPIRED: 12-21-07\n\nNew. #9054, eff 12-29-07, EXPIRED: 12-29-15\n\nNew. #12534, INTERIM, eff 5-24-18, EXPIRES: 11-20-18; ss by #12677, eff 11-20-18",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p1900.html"
